Original commit body from 4030d96:

Migrate Express-style route detection to the new UsageContext system.
The JS/TS analyzer now emits UsageContext records for app.get(),
router.post(), and other call-based route registrations, which are
matched against YAML patterns in express.yaml.

This extends v1.1.x UsageContext support to JavaScript/TypeScript
frameworks (Express, Fastify, Koa) following Django in PR #315.
